To run this MCP client springboot service, open Windows PowerShell and run below cmd

npm install -g @modelcontextprotocol/server-filesystem

use the  mcp-servers.json in location to make it run (C:\AKD\workplace\springAI\MCP-section7\mcpclient\src\main\resources\mcp-servers.json


To test and come to know about MCP server in detail and provided tool use github-inspector to connect and find out provided tool.
npx @modelcontextprotocol/inspector